{"articleNo":"2780","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2780&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"수강변경기간 및 과목 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.05","hit":"18404","attachments":[{"name":"첨부파일(등록용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2780&attachNo=2622"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◆ 수간변경 안내◆</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">■ 재학생 수강변경 기간 : 3.9(수) 10:00 ~ 3.11(금) 23:59 [3일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 116.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -116.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">■ 수강변경과목 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 116.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -116.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수강정원범위내에서는 수강신청시스템에서 추가/삭제 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 여석이 없는 경우 담당 교수의 서명을 받은 후 제출하되, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3과목 이상 변경(추가)학생은 [첨부1] 양식을 활용하여 담당교수의 서명 및 사유서에 사유를 상세히 기재한 후 해당 종합학사행정실로 위의 기간내에 제출<font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 2과목이내 신청자는 서명은 받되, 사유 기재 생략</p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">■ 수강변경시 확인 사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 23.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -23.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 강좌별로 수강정원을 확인하고[학부(과) 및 과목에 따라 수강정원이 조정될 수 있음] 수강신청시스템상으로 수강신청 한 후, 정원 초과 강좌의 경우 담당 교수의 서명을 받기 바람&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 116.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -116.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">■ 기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">타 사항은 금오광장→학교소식→학사안내(고정 게시물)「2011-1학기 수강</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청 안내」 사항 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">■&nbsp; 문의처 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 글로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">벌관종합학사행정실 : 478-7598</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 테크노관종합학사행정실 : 478-7359 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 디지털관종합학사행정실 : 478-7751</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 54pt; TEXT-INDENT: -54pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교무연구처 : 478-7029(기타 문의사항)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 116.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -116.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교무연구처장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
